<title>SRI LANKA: Colombo tea traders reelect De Zoysa chairman.</title>
<headline>Colombo tea traders reelect De Zoysa chairman.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The managing director of Lipton Ceylon, Michael de Zoysa, said on Thursday he had been reelected chairman of the Colombo Tea Traders' Association.</p>
<p>Lipton Ceylon is a division of Unilever Ceylon Ltd, a unit of Anglo-Dutch conglomerate Unilever.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
